    "lines": [
      "It's you!? I am guessing you succeeded the first",
      "test? I cannot find anyone who has had enough ",
      "power to pass the fist divine test. I don't know",
      "how you were able to complete the first divine ",
      "test.",
      "Anyway, I have spelled the weakness on you, this ",
      "curse will not be cured until you kill the ",
      "strongest $$%s.",
      "After you hunt 50 $$%s, we will be able to",
      "recognize that you are the member of kingdom and ",
      "cured the curse on you.",
      "If you die, while are doing the quest, come back ",
      "to me. If you're scare the quest, you will not have",
      "to do it.",
      "",
      "[Quest]",
      "After having hunted 50 $$%s, go back to Royal Mage Ray."
    ]
